      "\t\t\tthis.zoomSpeed = 1.0; // Set to false to disable rotating\n\n\t\t\tthis.enableRotate = true;\n\t\t\tthis.rotateSpeed = 1.0; // Set to false to disable panning\n\n\t\t\tthi",
