      "   } else {\r\n          const s = (py >= 0 ? 1 : -1) * oy * 0.60;\r\n          A.dy += s; B.dy -= s;\r\n        }\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n    if (!moved) break;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  f",
