      "none} }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<canvas id=\"scene\"></canvas>\n\n<div class=\"hud collapsed\" id=\"hud\">\n  <div class=\"ttl\" id=\"hudHead\">圆环内三球碰撞 <span id=\"hudTag\">甲</",
      "span><i id=\"hudTip\">展开</i></div>\n  <div class=\"giv\" id=\"giv\">R = v₀²/2g · m、2m、m · 全程光滑</div>\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n    <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"hk1\"",
      ">t·g/v₀</span><span class=\"v g\" id=\"hv1\">0.000</span></div>\n    <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"hk2\">v<sub>A</sub></span><span class=\"v ve\" id=\"hv2\">3.00</",
      "span></div>\n    <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"hk3\">v<sub>B</sub></span><span class=\"v c\" id=\"hv3\">0.00</span></div>\n    <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"k\" ",
      "id=\"hk4\">ΔE<sub>k</sub></span><span class=\"v g\" id=\"hv4\">0</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"row ph\"><span class=\"k\">阶段</span><span class=\"v\" id=\"hudPh\">A 匀速绕",
      "行</span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"chartMask\" id=\"chartMask\"></div>\n<div class=\"chartCard\" id=\"chartCard\">\n  <div class=\"chd\"><b>v-t 图像</b><span class=\"clg\" id=",
      "\"chartLeg\"></span><span id=\"chartNote\">A 3v₀ · B 静止</span><button class=\"cf\" id=\"btnChartFull\">全屏</button></div>\n  <canvas id=\"chart\"></canvas>\n</div>\n\n<div cla",
      "ss=\"stem collapsed\" id=\"stem\">\n  <div class=\"sh\" id=\"stemHead\"><b>题干</b><i id=\"stemTip\">点击展开</i></div>\n  <div class=\"sb\" id=\"stemBody\">\n    <p class=\"lead\">半径 <",
      "b class=\"k\">R = v₀²/2g</b> 的内壁光滑且绝缘的圆环，质量分别为 <b class=\"k\">m、2m、m</b> 的小球 A、B、C（半径远小于 R），不计相互间库仑力。（结果用 m、v₀、g 表示）</p>\n    <p class=\"ask\" id=\"q1\"><span class=\"q\">",
      "(1)</span>圆环竖直固定，竖直平面内有匀强电场 <b class=\"k\">E = mg/q</b> 竖直向上。A、B 分别带 <b class=\"k\">+q、+2q</b>，初始位置在圆环水平直径两端（图甲）。A 的初速度 <b class=\"k\">3v₀</b> 方向如图，B 静止。A、B 发生完全非弹性碰撞",
      "——碰后速度多大？损失了多少动能？</p>\n    <p class=\"ask\" id=\"q2\"><span class=\"q\">(2)</span>撤去 A，B 仍不带电；引入带 <b class=\"k\">+q</b> 的 C，初速度 <b class=\"k\">v₀</b> 方向如图乙，B 静止。电场变为 <b cl",
      "ass=\"k\">E′ = √2E</b>，方向与水平成 <b class=\"k\">45°</b> 斜向左上方。一段时间后 B、C 在某点发生完全非弹性碰撞——碰后速度多大？</p>\n    <p class=\"ask\" id=\"q3\"><span class=\"q\">(3)</span>撤去电场与所有电量，圆环放水平（",
      "图丙）：A、C 紧挨着，A、B 在直径两端，B 静止，A 以 <b class=\"k\">3v₀</b>、C 以 <b class=\"k\">v₀</b> 沿图示方向运动。所有碰撞均为弹性碰撞且时间极短——经多长时间三球又第一次恢复到图示初始位置？</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"lege",
      "nd\" id=\"legend\"></div>\n<div class=\"badge\" id=\"badge\"></div>\n\n<div id=\"panel\">\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <span class=\"lbl\">情形</span>\n    <button class=\"chip on\" da",
      "ta-sit=\"0\">甲 · 竖直电场 A 撞 B</button>\n    <button class=\"chip\" data-sit=\"1\">乙 · 斜向电场 B 撞 C</button>\n    <button class=\"chip\" data-sit=\"2\">丙 · 水平圆环 三球连撞</button>\n  ",
      "</div>\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <span class=\"lbl\">视角</span>\n    <button class=\"chip\" data-view=\"face\">正对</button>\n    <button class=\"chip on\" data-view=\"iso\">立体<",
      "/button>\n    <button class=\"chip\" data-view=\"side\">侧视</button>\n    <span class=\"lbl\" style=\"margin-left:6px\">显示</span>\n    <button class=\"chip on\" id=\"btnVel\">速",
      "度 v</button>\n    <button class=\"chip on\" id=\"btnForce\">受力</button>\n    <button class=\"chip on\" id=\"btnMark\">初始位置</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"row\" id=\"rowKey",
      "s\">\n    <span class=\"lbl\">关键</span>\n    <button id=\"btnK0\">① 初始</button>\n    <button id=\"btnK1\">② 碰撞</button>\n    <button id=\"btnK2\">③ 碰后</button>\n    <button i",
      "d=\"btnK3\">④ 复位</button>\n    <button id=\"btnAns\">揭晓答案</button>\n    <button id=\"btnAsk\">追问</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <button class=\"primary\" id=\"b",
      "tnPlay\">▶ 播放</button>\n    <button id=\"btnReset\">↺ 复位</button>\n    <input class=\"wide\" id=\"prog\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1000\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n    <span id",
      "=\"clock\">0.00</span>\n    <div class=\"fld\">播放速度<input class=\"w\" id=\"sSpeed\" type=\"range\" min=\"0.05\" max=\"0.5\" step=\"0.01\" value=\"0.35\"><b id=\"vSpeed\">0.35×</b></",
      "div>\n  </div>\n  <div id=\"readout\"></div>\n  <div class=\"ans hidden\" id=\"ansBox\"></div>\n  <div class=\"ans ask hidden\" id=\"askBox\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"selftest",
      "\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n\n<script>/*__GW_ENGINE:three-e88777b7__*/</script>\n<script>\n( function () {\n\n\t// Unlike TrackballControls, it maintains the \"up\" d",
      "irection object.up (+Y by default).\n\t//\n\t//    Orbit - left mouse / touch: one-finger move\n\t//    Zoom - middle mouse, or mousewheel / touch: two-finger spread ",
