      " s1 = 1, s2 = 1;\n  if (uu > 2 * K) { uu -= 2 * K; s1 = -1; s2 = -1; }\n  if (uu > K) { uu = 2 * K - uu; s2 = -s2; }\n  const a = [1], b = [Math.sqrt(Math.max(0, 1",
