      "st dv = new THREE.Vector3(d[0], d[1], 0).normalize();\n  const pv = new THREE.Vector3(-dv.y, dv.x, 0);\n  const mid = (n - 1) / 2;\n  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {",
