      "下\"标题＋图例＋注记＋全屏\"：注记与底部 readout 重复，砍掉 */\r\n  .chartCard .chd #chartNote{display:none}\r\n  .chartCard .chd .cf{margin-left:8px;font-size:9.5px;padding:1px 7px;border-",
      "radius:6px}\r\n  #chart{height:86px}\r\n  #rowKeys{display:none}\r\n  #panel{padding:5px 9px 6px;gap:3px;border-radius:12px;bottom:6px;max-height:46vh}\r\n  #panel .row",
