      "></div>\r\n<div class=\"chartCard\" id=\"chartCard\">\r\n  <div class=\"chd\"><b><i>v</i>-<i>t</i> 图像</b><span class=\"clg\" id=\"chartLeg\"></span><span id=\"chartNote\"></spa",
      "n><button class=\"cf\" id=\"btnChartFull\">全屏</button></div>\r\n  <canvas id=\"chart\"></canvas>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"stem collapsed\" id=\"stem\">\r\n  <div class=\"sh\" id",
