      "tDollyRotate( event );\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tstate = STATE.TOUCH_DOLLY_ROTATE;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tbreak;\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdefault:\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tstate = STATE.NONE;\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\tbreak;\n\n\t\t\t\t\tdefaul",
      "t:\n\t\t\t\t\t\tstate = STATE.NONE;\n\n\t\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\t\tif ( state !== STATE.NONE ) {\n\n\t\t\t\t\tscope.dispatchEvent( _startEvent );\n\n\t\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\tfunction onTouchMove( event ) ",
      "{\n\n\t\t\t\tif ( scope.enabled === false ) return;\n\t\t\t\tevent.preventDefault(); // prevent scrolling\n\n\t\t\t\tswitch ( state ) {\n\n\t\t\t\t\tcase STATE.TOUCH_ROTATE:\n\t\t\t\t\t\tif (",
