      "    S.add(circleLine(rOut, x, 0x5b87c4, 0.55));\r\n  });\r\n\r\n  /* ---- 阳极（金）/ 阴极（钢） ---- */\r\n  const mAnode = matStd(0x9a6f2c, 0.42, 0.65, 0x2a1a04);\r\n  const mCat",
