      "   tA: +P.tA.toFixed(6),\r\n    tA_formula: +((P.v3 / 4) / (MU * G)).toFixed(6)\r\n  };\r\n  if (sid === 's1') {\r\n    ans.t_top = +P.tLoop.toFixed(6);\r\n    ans.v_top ",
