      "    rise_q3_q4: q4.y - q3.y > 0,\r\n    v_drops_later: q4.v < q3.v,\r\n    phi_monotone: q2.phi > q1.phi && q4.phi > q3.phi,\r\n    bottom_is_ground: Math.abs(s0.y) <",
